#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068577 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068744 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4682b115-6156-5496-8faf-81000bcd993e" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring a Difference of Cubes"}] :question/id #uuid "eb4964f1-0462-5a41-b712-3d0d4dbd8c1b" :question/math-academy-id "e-4967" :question/problem "Factor $x^3 - 8.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\na^3-b^3=(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write the given expression as a difference of cubes:\n\n$$\nx^3 - 8 = x^3 - 2^3\n$$\n\nNow, we factor the given expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\nx^3 - 8 & = x^3 - 2^3\\[3pt]\n\n& = (x - 2)\\left(x^2 + 2\\cdot x + 2^2\\right)\\[3pt]\n\n& = (x - 2)\\left(x^2 + 2x + 4\\right)\t\t\n\t}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068578 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068745 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bb1e753f-ed91-5ba4-bd25-5fba48060d58" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring a Sum of Cubes"}] :question/id #uuid "c0f5e363-d4cd-5e31-bd25-6825209d58d4" :question/math-academy-id "e-4968" :question/problem "Factor $8n^3 + m^6.$" :question/worked-solution "The sum of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\na^3+b^3=(a+b)(a^2-ab+b^2).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a sum of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n8n^3 + m^6 = (2n)^3 + (m^2)^3\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the sum of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8{n}^{3}+{m}^{6} & =(2n)^{3}+({m}^{2})^{3} \\\\  & =(2n+{m}^{2})((2n)^{2}-2n\\cdot {m}^{2}+({m}^{2})^{2}) \\\\  & =(2n+{m}^{2})(4{n}^{2}-2{m}^{2}n+{m}^{4})\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068579 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068746 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "979f1a29-d9b2-50f1-9bef-252125d1021f" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring Sums and Differences of Cubes with Fractional Terms"}] :question/id #uuid "e90d590d-956d-5bb7-af6c-7572051b7f1a" :question/math-academy-id "e-4969" :question/problem "Factor $1 - \\dfrac 1 {t^9}.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\na^3-b^3=(a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2).\n$$\n\nNotice that our expression can be written as a difference of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n1 - \\dfrac{1}{t^9}  = 1^3 - \\left( \\dfrac{1}{t^3}\\right)^3\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{9}} & ={1}^{3}-{(\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}})}^{3} \\\\  & =(1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}})({1}^{2}+1\\cdot \\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}+{(\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}})}^{2}) \\\\  & =(1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}})(1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{({t}^{3})^{2}}) \\\\  & =(1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}})(1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{t}^{6}})\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186527226 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068746 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "979f1a29-d9b2-50f1-9bef-252125d1021f" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring Sums and Differences of Cubes with Fractional Terms"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "080f383a-cad7-506e-98f6-a6105a463e73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{z})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}-\\frac{2}{wz}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{2}})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526519} {:answer/id #uuid "1f2f5fad-489c-5ef2-abc8-2ead566193c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{1}{w}-\\frac{2}{z})(\\frac{1}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{wz}+\\frac{4}{{z}^{2}})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526571} {:answer/id #uuid "76707eb8-870b-5c30-8e98-237eddb6e483" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{2}{w}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}-\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{6}})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526735} {:answer/id #uuid "7bd1b9a5-c274-5960-8128-6e38205fa037" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{1}{w}+\\frac{2}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{1}{{w}^{2}}-\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{4}{{z}^{6}})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526746} {:answer/id #uuid "8121d101-b037-5fe7-a7e1-a87bb7b493b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{6}})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526760}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8121d101-b037-5fe7-a7e1-a87bb7b493b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{6}})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526760} :answer-field/id #uuid "c8a54896-3654-52b8-b0f1-96c46cbcf220" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186527099}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "efa83c70-ebda-58c7-9dc4-66acbcb8874b" :question/math-academy-id "q-112333" :question/problem "Factor $\\frac{8}{{w}^{3}}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{9}}.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{8}{{w}^{3}}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{9}}={(\\frac{2}{w})}^{3}-{(\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8}{{w}^{3}}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{9}} & ={(\\frac{2}{w})}^{3}-{(\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})({(\\frac{2}{w})}^{2}+\\frac{2}{w}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{z}^{3}}+{(\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})}^{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{({z}^{3})^{2}}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{6}})\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186527225 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068746 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "979f1a29-d9b2-50f1-9bef-252125d1021f" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring Sums and Differences of Cubes with Fractional Terms"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e1dd07c-e585-5339-8d34-c067ab9d0124" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{4}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+u+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526565} {:answer/id #uuid "3386a987-4784-5171-a2e1-094255e1eb0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{2}+1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{u}{2}+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526601} {:answer/id #uuid "4982dc80-f4cf-5d3a-be46-4ba2743eda41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{4}+1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}-u+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526649} {:answer/id #uuid "74bc0359-d645-51ed-8e8a-283c5a90cded" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{u}{2}+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526731} {:answer/id #uuid "7d464a43-e7cc-5052-8183-f2ac55c0f667" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+u+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526748}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74bc0359-d645-51ed-8e8a-283c5a90cded" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{u}{2}+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526731} :answer-field/id #uuid "7bf69bfe-f49c-586d-9712-8dbc31ce7c96" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186527071}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ee3cc387-c8ba-5e21-b6bf-54f77512a2c2" :question/math-academy-id "q-112336" :question/problem "Factor $\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1={(\\frac{u}{2})}^{3}-{1}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1 & ={(\\frac{u}{2})}^{3}-{1}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{u}{2}-1)({(\\frac{u}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{u}{2}\\cdot 1+{(1)}^{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{u}{2}+1)\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186527151 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068745 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bb1e753f-ed91-5ba4-bd25-5fba48060d58" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring a Sum of Cubes"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "49da2ae2-c4f6-5cd4-908d-593b0bd93d82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3c+1)(9{c}^{2}-6c+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526652} {:answer/id #uuid "5d996585-aedb-5cb1-a731-8c97295471b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3c-1)(9{c}^{2}-6c+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526692} {:answer/id #uuid "ab7be4de-9f6f-5921-8366-868072ddb0e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3c+1)(9{c}^{2}-3c+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526832} {:answer/id #uuid "b401fc5a-ef1e-5508-b2ca-a12d82139026" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3c+1)(3{c}^{2}+3c+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526849} {:answer/id #uuid "c8654cba-2f22-5d95-9767-ee02d487e0c0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(3c-1)(3{c}^{2}+3c+1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526887}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ab7be4de-